ESTYL "normal" [  ETI 0 EFI 5 ELV 1 AL 8 AA 45 COL 3 ]
ESTYL "gragra embed edge" [  ETI 2 EFI 7 ELV 1 AL 8 AA 45 COL 9 ]
DIR 1
GRAGRA 3 "[A-Z][a-zA-Z_$]*""[a-z_$]*" GEMBED "embedding" EMBMATCH 0
ELS 256 64

;
WA 4000 4000
WAWIN 446 410 796 592
SC 1673 1841
GR 16
